    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d678">

                <pb facs="0657" n="1391" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1391"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pera</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1895-12-15"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 15,
                    1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Missionaries at Aintab, Bitlis, Harpoot, Marsovan, Cæsarea safe and protected,
                    but apprehensive. Ladies at Hadjin, I believe, safe. Porte promises security for
                    all missionaries. Have telegraphed that I would <pb facs="0658" n="1392"
                        xml:id="pg1392"/> furnish ship to receive if they desired to visit home.
                    Gave no advice; they know dangers and must decide. Mails and telegrams less
                    impeded since my protest. Reliable information from interior provinces shows
                    destruction of many Armenian villages, massacre of men, desecration and burning
                    of monasteries and churches, murdering of priests, enforced circumcising of
                    boys, enforced religious conversion of Armenian women as the price of life. It
                    is believed now that from 30,000 to 40,000 have been killed during the last
                    sixty days. I expect daily to hear that the army of some 3,000 at Zeitoun and
                    town are annihilated. They are surrounded.</p>
                <p>* * * * * * *</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
